      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test 10: call menu, forwarding and voicemail\n1. **Unpublish test 1 first**: both use your new numbers (the ones marked \"not linked\").\n2. In **Menu Choices**, key 1, put a second phone of yours in **Forward To** (the agent).\n3. Pick your credential in the trigger and in **Download Voicemail**, then **Publish**.\n4. Call your n8n number and try 2 (hours), then 3 (voicemail), then 1 (agent; let it ring out once to hear the voicemail fallback).\n5. **Executions** shows a run for each key, the forward result, each voicemail (with the audio under **Download Voicemail**), and each call's end.",
        "width": 600,
        "height": 400
      }
    }
